2025-03-12 06:49:11,925 - INFO - chat_app.agent.agent_executor - agent_executor.execute:154 - Response: {'input': "I'm srinu and what about you?", 'chat_history': [{'role': 'user', 'content': 'Who are you?'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': 'I am RGUKT InfoGuru, the official virtual assistant for RGUKT Basar. My primary responsibility is to provide clear, accurate, and helpful answers based strictly on the provided context. I am here to assist you with any queries you may have, and I will do my best to provide you with the most relevant and helpful information available.'}], 'context': [Document(id='829ac48e-dadc-467f-bb50-2f647088ac9d', metadata={'creationdate': "D:20241229173339Z00'00'", 'creator': 'Pages', 'moddate': "D:20241229173339Z00'00'", 'page': 3, 'page_label': '4', 'producer': 'macOS Version 15.1 (Build 24B83) Quartz PDFContext', 'source': '../rguktBasarDataset/acadamic/administrativeSection.pdf', 'title': 'administrativeSection', 'total_pages': 4}, page_content='• Email: careers@rgukt.ac.in\nFinance & Accounts:\n• Shri G. Aneel Reddy – Finance Ofﬁcer (I/c) (Department: Finance & Accounts)\n• Email: fo@rgukt.ac.in\n• M. Srinivas – Technical Assistant (Department: Finance & Accounts)\n• Email: mittapellisrinivas@rgukt.ac.in\n• Jayaraju Paramalla – Technical Assistant (Department: Finance & Accounts)\n• Email: jayaraju.peramalla@rgukt.ac.in\nRajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge Technologies (RGUKT) - Basar \nOverview\nPublications and Public Relations (PPR) Ofﬁce \nOverview \nThe Publications and Public Relations (PPR) section at the Rajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge \nTechnologies (RGUKT) Basar is responsible for disseminating information related to academics, \nresearch, campus events, and achievements.\nThis section plays a vital role in bridging communication between the university and the outside \nworld, through various channels including the university website, press releases, and social media. \nThe team coordinates with various departments to provide updates and maintain an efﬁcient \ncommunication framework within the institution.'), Document(id='d9c40b32-a6f1-4376-8a85-ea89e9425988', metadata={'creationdate': "D:20241229173339Z00'00'", 'creator': 'Pages', 'moddate': "D:20241229173339Z00'00'", 'page': 3, 'page_label': '4', 'producer': 'macOS Version 15.1 (Build 24B83) Quartz PDFContext', 'source': '../rguktBasarDataset/acadamic/administrativeSection.pdf', 'title': 'administrativeSection', 'total_pages': 4}, page_content='• Email: careers@rgukt.ac.in\nFinance & Accounts:\n• Shri G. Aneel Reddy – Finance Ofﬁcer (I/c) (Department: Finance & Accounts)\n• Email: fo@rgukt.ac.in\n• M. Srinivas – Technical Assistant (Department: Finance & Accounts)\n• Email: mittapellisrinivas@rgukt.ac.in\n• Jayaraju Paramalla – Technical Assistant (Department: Finance & Accounts)\n• Email: jayaraju.peramalla@rgukt.ac.in\nRajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge Technologies (RGUKT) - Basar \nOverview\nPublications and Public Relations (PPR) Ofﬁce \nOverview \nThe Publications and Public Relations (PPR) section at the Rajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge \nTechnologies (RGUKT) Basar is responsible for disseminating information related to academics, \nresearch, campus events, and achievements.\nThis section plays a vital role in bridging communication between the university and the outside \nworld, through various channels including the university website, press releases, and social media. \nThe team coordinates with various departments to provide updates and maintain an efﬁcient \ncommunication framework within the institution.'), Document(id='8892441f-9e97-4ac0-9bf4-0163803c72d3', metadata={'creationdate': "D:20241229172236Z00'00'", 'creator': 'Pages', 'moddate': "D:20241229172236Z00'00'", 'page': 0, 'page_label': '1', 'producer': 'macOS Version 15.1 (Build 24B83) Quartz PDFContext', 'source': '../rguktBasarDataset/tnp/trainingAndPlacements.pdf', 'title': 'trainingAndPlacements', 'total_pages': 11}, page_content='Contact Us - RGUKT Placement Cell\nFor Corporate Houses & Institutions: If you are interested in recruiting students from RGUKT, \nplease get in touch with the following team:\nOfﬁcers on Charge:\n• Mr. G Srinivas Sagar \nAssistant Professor, Faculty In-Charge \nEmail: tnp@rgukt.ac.in\n• Mrs. D. Srujana \nAssistant Professor, Addl. Training & Placement Ofﬁcer\n• Mr. Dr. N. Vijay Kumar \nAssistant Professor, Training Program Ofﬁcer\nT&P Staff:\n• Mr. Mohanbabu T \nTechnical Assistant, Placement Cell \nPhone: 9493498540 \nEmail: tnp.rguktb@gmail.com\nOfﬁce Address:\nTraining & Placement Cell \nRajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge Technologies (RGUKT) \nVillage Basar, District Nirmal, Telangana State - 504107 \nLocation: RGUKT Basar Map\nAbout RGUKT (Rajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge Technologies)\nVision & Mission:\n• Established: 2008 by the erstwhile Government of Andhra Pradesh (now Telangana).\n• Objective: To provide high-quality education to meritorious rural students in Telangana \nthrough a six-year integrated B.Tech program. The ﬁrst two years focus on foundation \ncourses in Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, English, and Telugu, while the next four years \nspecialize in various engineering disciplines.\n• Unique Feature: The university emphasizes ICT-based teaching and is the ﬁrst of its kind in \nthe country.\nAcademic Excellence:\n• 85% of students are rural youths from Telangana, mostly from the top 1% of graduates in \ngovernment schools.\n• Residential campus with state-of-the-art infrastructure, including modern laboratories, \nlibraries with over 7,00,000 volumes, and well-designed sports and academic facilities.\n• Located on the banks of the river Godavari, near the famous Gnana Saraswati Temple.\nInfrastructure & Facilities:'), Document(id='ed1d7663-4749-4e0d-9598-6bdc01bee748', metadata={'creationdate': "D:20241229172236Z00'00'", 'creator': 'Pages', 'moddate': "D:20241229172236Z00'00'", 'page': 0, 'page_label': '1', 'producer': 'macOS Version 15.1 (Build 24B83) Quartz PDFContext', 'source': '../rguktBasarDataset/tnp/trainingAndPlacements.pdf', 'title': 'trainingAndPlacements', 'total_pages': 11}, page_content='Contact Us - RGUKT Placement Cell\nFor Corporate Houses & Institutions: If you are interested in recruiting students from RGUKT, \nplease get in touch with the following team:\nOfﬁcers on Charge:\n• Mr. G Srinivas Sagar \nAssistant Professor, Faculty In-Charge \nEmail: tnp@rgukt.ac.in\n• Mrs. D. Srujana \nAssistant Professor, Addl. Training & Placement Ofﬁcer\n• Mr. Dr. N. Vijay Kumar \nAssistant Professor, Training Program Ofﬁcer\nT&P Staff:\n• Mr. Mohanbabu T \nTechnical Assistant, Placement Cell \nPhone: 9493498540 \nEmail: tnp.rguktb@gmail.com\nOfﬁce Address:\nTraining & Placement Cell \nRajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge Technologies (RGUKT) \nVillage Basar, District Nirmal, Telangana State - 504107 \nLocation: RGUKT Basar Map\nAbout RGUKT (Rajiv Gandhi University of Knowledge Technologies)\nVision & Mission:\n• Established: 2008 by the erstwhile Government of Andhra Pradesh (now Telangana).\n• Objective: To provide high-quality education to meritorious rural students in Telangana \nthrough a six-year integrated B.Tech program. The ﬁrst two years focus on foundation \ncourses in Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, English, and Telugu, while the next four years \nspecialize in various engineering disciplines.\n• Unique Feature: The university emphasizes ICT-based teaching and is the ﬁrst of its kind in \nthe country.\nAcademic Excellence:\n• 85% of students are rural youths from Telangana, mostly from the top 1% of graduates in \ngovernment schools.\n• Residential campus with state-of-the-art infrastructure, including modern laboratories, \nlibraries with over 7,00,000 volumes, and well-designed sports and academic facilities.\n• Located on the banks of the river Godavari, near the famous Gnana Saraswati Temple.\nInfrastructure & Facilities:')], 'answer': "Nice to meet you, Srinu! As I mentioned earlier, I am RGUKT InfoGuru, the official virtual assistant for RGUKT Basar. I'm here to help you with any questions or concerns you may have related to RGUKT or its various departments, including the Publications and Public Relations (PPR) Office, Finance & Accounts, and the Placement Cell. Feel free to ask me anything, and I'll do my best to provide you with accurate and helpful information!"}
